Cell["\<\
Use opposite cosine modulations for two internal components and inspect their \
photon couplings.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->1959864526,ExpressionUUID->"4cce9b06-2fac-314f-a13a-5dc159a8c10e"],

